# Structure

orchestrator/      - dispatch, planning, result synthesis
workers/<name>/    - one folder per worker type; each contains its runtime code
prompts/<name>/    - versioned system prompts, vN.md per version
eval/<name>/       - golden-set test cases + scoring for that worker
dashboard/         - React + React Flow frontend
specs/<ticket>/    - requirements.md, design.md, tasks.md for the ticket in progress; delete
                     or archive after merge

Branch naming: feature/<ticket-name>. One ticket = one branch = one agent session.
Every ticket that touches a prompt file must show an eval score in its PR description before merge.
